    <text x="200" y="20" font-size="10.5" fill="#6B7280" text-anchor="middle" paint-order="stroke" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linejoin="round">길이를 k 배 하면 넓이는 몇 배가 될까</text>
